0 FILE apex.ldr
0 Apex — Wankel rotary demonstrator
0 Name: apex.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LICENSE BSD-3-Clause : see ../licenses/apex.txt
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // Rebuilt 2026-10-24 from the documented Apex design after loss of the earlier workspace.
0 // New file identity: validation applies only to this rebuilt model and paired program.
0 // One SPIKE Prime hub; one medium angular motor on port A.
0 // Stock 20:28 carrier drive, fixed 16:8 / 8:24 compound train, eccentric open three-apex rotor.
0 // Every reference is a stock part; no custom joints, fixed model bodies or commanded output poses.
0 // Open kinematics model; not a sealed combustion engine.
